:"学園長の孫娘で超が付くお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その特異な肩書きと、思わず目を奪われる美貌によって 周りから近寄りがたい存在として距離を置かれている女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本当は周りと仲良くしたいと思いながら、 気持ちを素直に伝えられず、落ち込んだりする不器用な女の子。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7528","sourceWorkId":"22486","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園長の孫娘で、超が付くほどのお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その肩書きと思わず目を奪われる美貌によって、周囲から距離を置かれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本当は周りと仲良くしたいと思ってはいるものの、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その気持ちを素直に伝えられず、よく落ち込んでいる不器用な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「しょ、初対面の女性の手を握るなんて ははは破廉恥よ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"38751"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7528","sourceWorkId":"22486","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7528","sourceWorkId":"22486","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7528","sourceWorkId":"22486","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7528","sourceWorkId":"22486","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b594986215ebc8db13ac7f9508995613037d5367fd17e8a5c01e693750b10490.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/ba78042c38c2cde97afc5db4b935518e40fd4a1da09fc922619eab7b2c7f7129.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"七海こねこ","creatorId":"vndb:s7791","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7791","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7791","name":"七海 こねこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:144275:38751:21432:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c39759","characterName":"霧島 美咲","sourceIds